      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sub_011_takara_cook_01",
      "hash64": "237870EE06E9D142",
      "text": "這位同學！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳和青木的對戰非常精彩！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sub_011_takara_cook_02",
      "hash64": "23786FEE06E9CF8F",
      "text": "我啊，只把特別的料理\\n提供給我中意的客人，\\r\\n而那個料理能改變寶可夢的太晶屬性！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sub_011_takara_cook_03",
      "hash64": "23786EEE06E9CDDC",
      "text": "我需要叫做太晶碎塊的材料，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳收集到了之後就來找我吧！\\c\\n作為第一次的特典，\\n就送[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳能把太晶屬性變成一般的道具！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
