    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sub_011_takara_cook_05",
      "hash64": "23786CEE06E9CA76",
      "text": "總共需要５０個太晶碎塊！\\n……好像不太夠啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sub_011_takara_cook_06",
      "hash64": "23786BEE06E9C8C3",
      "text": "我來製作特別的料理，\\n幫[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳改變寶可夢的太晶屬性！\\c\\n材料需要５０個叫做太晶碎塊的東西，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳去收集來給我吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
